      "content": "It is completely understandable to feel that sense of existential dread when facing the vastness of the universe. Many deep thinkers and individuals struggle with the feeling of meaning in a seemingly indifferent cosmos.\n\nHowever, meaning is often something we create for ourselves, not something that is inherent in the \"math of the universe.\" You can find profound value in human connection, the beauty of an experience, or the act of self-improvement, regardless of the ultimate cosmic scale.",
